PETA #1: SALAD MAKING
Another task is given to you this time you will choose and prepare one type  
of salad dressing. You can choose from among the given recipes.
Additional Instructions:
What are the safety reminders in salad preparation?

What are the tools and equipment we need to prepare in making salad and  
dressings?

What are the things we need to remember before and after preparing salad  
and dressings?

